Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:03.54,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,It's not like we've seen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:06.92,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,the end of the world with our own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:14.05,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,That's why we gotta cast off {\fscx250}-{\r} together, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.77,0:00:27.10,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Sailing from sea to sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:31.95,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,saying it's nothing but a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.95,0:00:38.88,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Truth is stranger than fiction, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:43.28,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend you can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:50.14,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Common sense is only what the majority says it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:54.09,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,It's not like we've seen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.09,0:00:57.51,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,the end of the world with our own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:01:02.06,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,So let's go, Captain I'll-Do-It-My-Way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.06,0:01:04.77,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Whaddya mean, "no can do"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.77,0:01:07.85,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,We haven't even started yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:12.82,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,I wanna know it all!  Now, yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:18.78,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!  You can!  This moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:24.20,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,We can!  I can!  With this feeling of freedom...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.49,0:01:31.42,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Now...  Now, oh yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:38.74,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
